@startuml

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam stateBorderColor #2E86C1
skinparam stateFontColor #154360

[*] --> Draft

Draft --> Published : Publish
Published --> Active : Start Date Reached
Active --> SoldOut : All Tickets Sold
Active --> Cancelled : Cancel Event
Active --> Completed : End Date Reached
SoldOut --> Completed : End Date Reached
Published --> Cancelled : Cancel Event
Draft --> Cancelled : Cancel Event
Cancelled --> Archived : Archive Event
Completed --> Archived : Archive Event

@enduml